### Summary

The change does what the PR says. Picking the folder a workspace already uses now returns an `unchanged: true` flag, and that flag passes through the IPC result to `onRelocated`, which shows no toast. The `pendingInit` fix in `edit` keeps the flag when the identity was not written to the folder, and a new test covers it. I found no defects. One minor gap remains: nothing tests the renderer skip or the `index.ts` passthrough of `unchanged`. Two earlier threads (4439336705 and 4439290177) are addressed by the current code.

